==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*Dunavь}}, from {{der|sh|got|*𐌳𐍉𐌽𐌰𐍅𐌹}}, from {{der|sh|gem-pro|*Dōnawjaz}}, from {{der|sh|cel-pro|*Dānowyos}} (whence also {{cog|la|Danubius}}), an extended form of the river-name {{m|cel-pro|*Dānu}}, from {{der|sh|ine-pro|*déh₂nu||river goddess}}, akin to {{m|ine-pro|*dʰenh₂-||to set in motion; to flow}}.

